<concept id="t00332">
	<title>Turning off the front air climate control</title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>automatic climate control system
					<indexterm>turning off the front air climate control</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e02111">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="0" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colsep="0" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e02112">
								<image href="images/KIA_C00_051.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2">
							<fig id="e02113">
								<image href="images/N_SP327_C08_012.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<ul id="e02114">
			<li>
				<p>To turn the climate control system off, touch and hold the icon (1) or press and hold down the fan speed control lever (2).</p>
			</li>
			<li>
				<p>You can operate the mode and air intake control buttons as long as the vehicle is in <term translate="no">ON</term> position.</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</conbody>
